        "Content": "•\tLovely three-bedroom semi-detached house\r\n•\tExtending to 87.3 sq.m/ 940 sq.ft\r\n•\tExcellent potential to further extend or convert the attic\r\n•\tSet on a quiet & mature residential cul de sac\r\n•\tLovely, private west facing rear garden\r\n•\tOff-street parking\r\n•\tMonitored burglar alarm\r\n•\tGas fired central heating, electric underfloor heating to ground floor & double glazing\r\n•\tWalking distance to Rathfarnham and Terenure villages\r\n•\tA choice of excellent schools in the area\r\n•\tBushy Park, Rathfarnham Castle and the Dodder Greenway on your doorstep\r\n•\tGood public transport (15B, 15D, 16, 16D & 74 bus routes)\r\n•\tEasy access to the M50 and national road network"
